{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a lone cyberpunk swordsman with a cool trick up their sleeve\u2014learning and copying enemy skills. This game is all about turn-based action in a futuristic cyberpunk world, where strategic positioning on the 2D playing field is crucial as you battle your way to confront the final boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Turn-based Action: Strategize every move as each character takes their turn. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/UsingEnemyAbility-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rogue-like Gameplay with Progression: Encounter new enemies during gameplay, defeat them to unlock their unique skills. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/movie_013-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deck Building Elements: Experiment with various combos and construct your starter deck to bring with you. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/PurchaseSliceThrough-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Replayability: Experience randomized enemies in each run, ensuring no two runs are alike. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique enemies: Encounter diverse enemies, each bringing a new challenge to overcome. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/Idle_Video-optimize.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique maps: Each part of the game has a unique set of enemies, synergizing with each other, bringing new challenges. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the day though, it\u2019s YOUR skills as a player that matter most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a journey of continual improvement, transforming once-daunting obstacles into a stroll in the park.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832180?t=1743180368","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832180?t=1743180368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743180368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743180368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2846780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist now.</h1><p>Add the game to your Wishlist to not miss out on anything new!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/wishlist.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of a lone cyberpunk swordsman with a cool trick up their sleeve\u2014learning and copying enemy skills. This game is all about turn-based action in a futuristic cyberpunk world, where strategic positioning on the 2D playing field is crucial as you battle your way to confront the final boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Turn-based Action: Strategize every move as each character takes their turn. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/UsingEnemyAbility-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Rogue-like Gameplay with Progression: Encounter new enemies during gameplay, defeat them to unlock their unique skills. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/movie_013-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Deck Building Elements: Experiment with various combos and construct your starter deck to bring with you. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/PurchaseSliceThrough-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Replayability: Experience randomized enemies in each run, ensuring no two runs are alike. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique enemies: Encounter diverse enemies, each bringing a new challenge to overcome. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832180/extras/Idle_Video-optimize.gif?t=1743180368\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique maps: Each part of the game has a unique set of enemies, synergizing with each other, bringing new challenges. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of the day though, it\u2019s YOUR skills as a player that matter most!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a journey of continual improvement, transforming once-daunting obstacles into a stroll in the park.</p>","developers":["PixelHeroForge"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset